[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "樹里、レッスンお疲れ様\r\nずいぶん頑張ってたみたいだな",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "011",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00014",
    "bgm": "012",
    "charCategory": "stand_jersey"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030010,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……そうか？\r\n別に、このくらい普通じゃね－の？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その普通が中々できないから言ってるんだよ\r\n真面目にレッスンしてくれてるみたいで、うれしいぞ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030020,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "なんだそりゃ……\r\nやるって決めたんだ、ちゃんとやるっての",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030030,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "それにレッスン……練習って聞くと\r\nしっかりやるぞって気になるんだよな",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "へぇ……それにしても、ダンスを見てると\r\n樹里の動きにはキレがあるよな",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "前に何かスポ－ツでもやってたのか？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030040,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ん－……\r\nまぁ、バスケをちょっとな",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほどな\r\n樹里のダンスのキレや体力は、バスケから来てたんだな",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030050,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ああ、そうかもな\r\nあの頃は、けっこ－必死にやってたし……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "へぇ、そうかそうか……",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030060,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……なんだよ。必死にやってたなんて\r\nアタシには似合わね－とでも言いて－のか？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやいや、そんなこと言ってないだろ\r\nむしろ俺は、しっくり来ると考えてたくらいだ",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "樹里が真面目なのはよく知ってるし\r\nバスケをやってたころも、さぞ頑張ってたんだろうな",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030070,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……まあ、昔の話だけどな",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ん？珍しく歯切れが悪いな）",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "juri"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030080,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "で、話は終わりかよ？\r\nだったらアタシは、もうちょっとレッスンしてくるけど……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ああ、引き留めたみたいで悪かったな\r\nいろいろ話を聞かせてくれて、ありがとう",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……だけど、運動経験があるってのは大きな武器になるな\r\n今後はその運動能力を活かしてアイドルしていければ……",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030090,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "あ？どういうことだよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030090"
  },
  {
    "charLipAnim": "blank",
    "charLabel": "juri"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　ああ、思い付きで言っただけだから\r\n具体的なところまで決めてるわけじゃないが……",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "けど、そうだな……\r\n樹里に似合いそうな方向性か……",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "歌って踊れる\r\nスーパーアイドル",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "スポ－ティな\r\n爽やかアイドル",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "ちょっと柄の悪い\r\nク－ルアイドル",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "歌って踊れるス－パ－アイドル……とか？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030100,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "はあ？　歌って踊れるって……\r\nアイドルはみんなそういうもんだろ？",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、樹里の持っている身体能力は\r\n簡単に真似できるものじゃないからな",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "キレのあるダンス、それに歌いながら踊るために\r\n必要なスタミナが、樹里には備わっているんだ",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これは大きな強みだぞ。きっと樹里なら\r\n他のアイドルよりもっと上にいけるはずだ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030110,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ふ－ん……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_a",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030120,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "まあ、本当にそうなれるかどうかは置いといて\r\nそれなら、踊れるだけじゃなくて歌えね－とダメだよな？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030130,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ってことはアタシ\r\nもっと歌のレッスンもしたほうがいいんじゃね－か？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（おお……！\r\n樹里の方からレッスンの提案をしてくれるなんて……）",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし、わかった！\r\nそれじゃあ今すぐ歌のレッスンの予約をしてこよう！",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030140,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "はあっ！？　今すぐって……\r\nアンタ、なんでそんなにやる気なんだよ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなの決まってるだろ。せっかく樹里がやる気なんだ\r\n俺もできる限りのサポ－トをしないとだろ？",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "blank",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030150,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "べ、別にアタシはやる気とかじゃ……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030160,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "けど、アタシのために動いてくれてんだよな……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうした？\r\n俺の顔をじっと見て？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030170,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……なんでもね－よ\r\nアンタもけっこ－やる気あるヤツなんだなって思っただけ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "スポ－ティな爽やかアイドルなんて\r\n似合いそうじゃないか？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030180,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "はあ？　何言ってんだよ\r\nアタシのどこが爽やかなんだよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？\r\nそんなに違和感があるか？",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ショ－トカットだし、ダンスもキレがあるし、\r\nスポ－ツ少女って感じで爽やかじゃないか",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030190,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "いや……この金髪で爽やかはね－だろ\r\n……まさか、黒髪に染め直せって言うのか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなこと言わないさ\r\n樹里には今の髪型が似合ってると思うし",
    "charLipAnim": "blank",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030200,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……ふぅん。そういや\r\n初めて会ったときにもそんなこと言ってたっけ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうした、樹里？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030210,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……別に、どうもしね－よ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030220,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ま、髪が気になんね－なら、アタシはかまわね－よ\r\nスポ－ティな爽やかアイドルだっけか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030230,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "もともと、体を動かすのは嫌いじゃね－しな\r\nアンタの案に乗ってやるよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……！\r\nありがとう、樹里！",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030240,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "感謝されても、爽やかにできる自信はね－からな？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫さ。俺もアドバイスするし、\r\nまずはやってみることが大切だからな",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030250,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "はいはい\r\n……頼りにしてるぜ、プロデュ－サ－",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ちょっと柄の悪いク－ルアイドルって感じかな",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030260,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "待て待て待て！\r\nそれ、アイドルとして大丈夫なのかよ！？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫だ。むしろ、アイドルをやっていく上では\r\n強烈な個性が必要なんだよ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030270,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "強烈な個性……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030270"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030280,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "んなこと言われても、\r\nアイドルと柄の悪さって相性悪いんじゃね－のか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことないさ\r\nアイドルにはギャップも大切だからな",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "見た目でちょっと柄が悪そうに見えても、\r\n根が優しければ、ちゃんとファンもついてくれるんだよ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001030290,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ふ－ん……そういうもんなのか",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100103/1011001030290"
  },
  {
